# The sqcart revision this tree is built and tested against.
#
# A commit, a tag, or a branch. tools/bootstrap.sh checks it out; --update
# records the current checkout here.
#
# This file is the difference between a reproducible tree and "whatever main
# was that day". When sqcart moves to cartridge format 3 and this engine still
# implements 2, an unpinned clone builds cleanly and then refuses every
# cartridge, blaming the cartridge.
main
